# name: test/sql/duckfn_quantstats.test
# description: smoke test — the extension loads under its own name / 冒烟测试：扩展能按自己的名字加载
# group: [quantstats]

# `require` 会让测试运行器从这一行起加载扩展（文件名即扩展名），
# 入口符号与扩展名不一致时会直接失败。
#
# Require statement will ensure the extension is loaded from now on.
# It fails if the entry-point symbol does not match the extension name.
require duckfn_quantstats
